- **Balance (set A, {{ r.balance_set_A.n_covariates }} indicators):** max |SMD| {{ "%.3f" | format(r.balance_set_A.max_abs_smd_before) }} before weighting and {{ "%.3f" | format(r.balance_set_A.max_abs_smd_after) }} after. Balance on *measured* covariates says nothing about unmeasured ones.

